{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维与持续保障","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-budgets-ci","title":"性能预算与 CI 集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations/performance-budgets-ci","wordCount":699,"readingTime":3},{"seq":2,"slug":"alerting-regression-detection","title":"告警与回归检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations/alerting-regression-detection","wordCount":679,"readingTime":3},{"seq":3,"slug":"spa-monitoring-challenges","title":"SPA 监控与软导航挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-performance-monitoring/operations/spa-monitoring-challenges","wordCount":903,"readingTime":4}],"introMarkdown":"# 运维与持续保障\n\n性能优化不是一锤子买卖——今天的 LCP 达标，明天一次依赖升级就可能打回原形。真正成熟的性能工程需要将监控能力嵌入开发流水线，使回归在合入代码前就被拦截，在发布后被秒级发现。\n\n本章覆盖三个运维关键环节：性能预算在 CI 中的落地与守护、生产环境的实时告警与回归检测机制、以及单页应用（SPA）软导航场景下的特殊监控挑战。三者组合构成从开发到上线的完整性能保障闭环。\n"}